<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ foreign debt NZ$76.4 billion at Sept 30.</title>
<headline>NZ foreign debt NZ$76.4 billion at Sept 30.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand released the following data on Monday on New Zealand's total foreign debt as at September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Figures are in billions of NZ dollars, and have been rounded. Figures before revision in brackets.</p>
<p>		  Sept 30, 1996    June 30, 1996    Sept 30, 1995</p>
<p>Total		76.4		76.2		   70.7</p>
<p>Official Gvt     22.65	     23.38		  21.42</p>
<p>Other sector     53.75	     52.77		  49.28</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
